{"lines": [{"text": "You have probably heard this one: skip your coffee, invest the money, and you will become a millionaire.", "start": 0.6, "end": 6.072, "spec": {"type": "hook", "img": 1}, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.148], ["have", 0.148, 0.227], ["probably", 0.227, 0.534], ["heard", 0.545, 0.773], ["this", 0.773, 0.943], ["one", 0.943, 1.136], ["skip", 1.602, 1.852], ["your", 1.852, 1.943], ["coffee", 1.955, 2.42], ["invest", 2.648, 3.034], ["the", 3.034, 3.091], ["money", 3.091, 3.534], ["and", 3.909, 4.011], ["you", 4.011, 4.114], ["will", 4.114, 4.182], ["become", 4.182, 4.5], ["a", 4.5, 4.523], ["millionaire", 4.523, 5.148]]}, {"text": "Sounds great, right? But is it actually true? Or is it just a nice myth from the internet?", "start": 6.472, "end": 11.608, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "myth", "img": 2}, "words": [["Sounds", 0.091, 0.284], ["great", 0.284, 0.557], ["right", 0.557, 0.784], ["But", 1.136, 1.193], ["is", 1.193, 1.261], ["it", 1.261, 1.33], ["actually", 1.33, 1.693], ["true", 1.705, 2.17], ["Or", 2.534, 2.659], ["is", 2.943, 3.0], ["it", 3.0, 3.057], ["just", 3.057, 3.205], ["a", 3.205, 3.239], ["nice", 3.239, 3.727], ["myth", 3.739, 4.125], ["from", 4.136, 4.295], ["the", 4.295, 4.364], ["internet", 4.364, 4.807]]}, {"text": "In this video we do the honest math, with real numbers and no sugarcoating.", "start": 12.008, "end": 16.688, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "honest", "img": 3}, "words": [["In", 0.091, 0.17], ["this", 0.17, 0.33], ["video", 0.341, 0.75], ["we", 0.761, 0.955], ["do", 0.955, 1.136], ["the", 1.136, 1.25], ["honest", 1.261, 1.625], ["math", 1.625, 2.068], ["with", 2.284, 2.466], ["real", 2.477, 2.739], ["numbers", 2.739, 3.216], ["and", 3.364, 3.5], ["no", 3.511, 3.705], ["sugarcoating", 3.705, 4.352]]}, {"text": "And by the end, you will understand what really works, and what leads you astray.", "start": 17.088, "end": 21.84, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "fork", "img": 4}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.159], ["by", 0.159, 0.33], ["the", 0.341, 0.409], ["end", 0.409, 0.83], ["you", 1.273, 1.364], ["will", 1.364, 1.455], ["understand", 1.466, 2.023], ["what", 2.023, 2.216], ["really", 2.216, 2.489], ["works", 2.489, 3.045], ["and", 3.193, 3.318], ["what", 3.33, 3.523], ["leads", 3.523, 3.83], ["you", 3.83, 3.92], ["astray", 3.92, 4.42]]}, {"text": "Phase one: the coffee math.", "start": 22.24, "end": 24.304, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 1, "title": "The coffee math", "img": 5}, "words": [["Phase", 0.148, 0.341], ["one", 0.341, 0.636], ["the", 0.898, 0.966], ["coffee", 0.977, 1.307], ["math", 1.307, 1.739]]}, {"text": "Let's say your coffee costs four euros. Every single day, for a year. That adds up to almost fourteen hundred and sixty euros.", "start": 24.704, "end": 31.592, "spec": {"type": "calc", "group": "calc1", "step": 0, "img": 6}, "words": [["Let's", 0.091, 0.193], ["say", 0.193, 0.284], ["your", 0.284, 0.386], ["coffee", 0.386, 0.75], ["costs", 0.761, 1.125], ["four", 1.125, 1.33], ["euros", 1.33, 1.864], ["Every", 2.239, 2.466], ["single", 2.477, 2.693], ["day", 2.693, 2.955], ["for", 2.966, 3.125], ["a", 3.125, 3.148], ["year", 3.148, 3.5], ["That", 3.875, 4.0], ["adds", 4.0, 4.273], ["up", 4.284, 4.409], ["to", 4.42, 4.557], ["almost", 4.568, 4.955], ["fourteen", 4.966, 5.443], ["hundred", 5.455, 5.67], ["and", 5.67, 5.716], ["sixty", 5.716, 6.045], ["euros", 6.045, 6.545]]}, {"text": "That is about one hundred and twenty euros a month vanishing into your coffee cup.", "start": 31.992, "end": 36.0, "spec": {"type": "calc", "group": "calc1", "step": 1, "img": 7}, "words": [["That", 0.091, 0.159], ["is", 0.159, 0.239], ["about", 0.239, 0.477], ["one", 0.477, 0.568], ["hundred", 0.568, 0.864], ["and", 0.864, 0.898], ["twenty", 0.909, 1.114], ["euros", 1.125, 1.58], ["a", 1.67, 1.705], ["month", 1.716, 2.205], ["vanishing", 2.318, 2.83], ["into", 2.83, 2.989], ["your", 3.0, 3.08], ["coffee", 3.091, 3.375], ["cup", 3.375, 3.659]]}, {"text": "Now imagine you invest exactly that amount every month instead of spending it.", "start": 36.4, "end": 41.248, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "right", "ov": "months", "img": 8}, "words": [["Now", 0.08, 0.261], ["imagine", 0.42, 0.818], ["you", 0.818, 1.023], ["invest", 1.034, 1.477], ["exactly", 1.477, 2.114], ["that", 2.114, 2.273], ["amount", 2.273, 2.614], ["every", 2.75, 3.011], ["month", 3.011, 3.432], ["instead", 3.557, 3.898], ["of", 3.898, 3.943], ["spending", 3.943, 4.33], ["it", 4.33, 4.5]]}, {"text": "We calculate with seven percent return per year. That is a commonly quoted average for broadly diversified stock ETFs over a very long time.", "start": 41.648, "end": 49.808, "spec": {"type": "stat", "value": 7, "suf": " %", "label": "return per year", "sub": "long-term average often quoted for broad stock ETFs", "img": 9}, "words": [["We", 0.08, 0.17], ["calculate", 0.17, 0.716], ["with", 0.727, 0.864], ["seven", 0.875, 1.193], ["percent", 1.205, 1.659], ["return", 1.67, 2.011], ["per", 2.011, 2.193], ["year", 2.193, 2.568], ["That", 2.932, 3.0], ["is", 3.0, 3.057], ["a", 3.057, 3.114], ["commonly", 3.125, 3.648], ["quoted", 3.648, 4.023], ["average", 4.023, 4.386], ["for", 4.432, 4.591], ["broadly", 4.602, 5.034], ["diversified", 5.034, 5.648], ["stock", 5.648, 5.898], ["ETFs", 5.898, 6.557], ["over", 6.75, 6.932], ["a", 6.932, 6.966], ["very", 6.966, 7.216], ["long", 7.216, 7.443], ["time", 7.443, 7.807]]}, {"text": "Important: this is not a guarantee. Some years the market drops hard, other years it climbs a lot.", "start": 50.208, "end": 55.944, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "swings", "img": 10}, "words": [["Important", 0.091, 0.568], ["this", 0.989, 1.125], ["is", 1.125, 1.227], ["not", 1.227, 1.455], ["a", 1.466, 1.5], ["guarantee", 1.5, 2.057], ["Some", 2.42, 2.568], ["years", 2.568, 2.841], ["the", 2.852, 2.92], ["market", 2.92, 3.205], ["drops", 3.205, 3.466], ["hard", 3.466, 3.784], ["other", 4.045, 4.227], ["years", 4.227, 4.58], ["it", 4.58, 4.636], ["climbs", 4.636, 4.943], ["a", 4.955, 4.989], ["lot", 5.0, 5.386]]}, {"text": "Phase two: compound interest.", "start": 56.344, "end": 58.6, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 2, "title": "Compound interest", "img": 11}, "words": [["Phase", 0.148, 0.33], ["two", 0.33, 0.659], ["compound", 0.92, 1.409], ["interest", 1.42, 1.932]]}, {"text": "Albert Einstein supposedly called it the eighth wonder of the world. Whether that is true is unclear, but the idea behind it is solid.", "start": 59.0, "end": 67.256, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "quote", "img": 12}, "words": [["Albert", 0.091, 0.409], ["Einstein", 0.409, 0.977], ["supposedly", 1.057, 1.795], ["called", 1.807, 2.136], ["it", 2.136, 2.205], ["the", 2.205, 2.307], ["eighth", 2.5, 2.739], ["wonder", 2.75, 3.091], ["of", 3.091, 3.136], ["the", 3.136, 3.205], ["world", 3.205, 3.591], ["Whether", 3.955, 4.159], ["that", 4.159, 4.273], ["is", 4.284, 4.375], ["true", 4.375, 4.864], ["is", 4.955, 5.182], ["unclear", 5.193, 5.841], ["but", 6.25, 6.341], ["the", 6.341, 6.432], ["idea", 6.443, 6.932], ["behind", 6.932, 7.318], ["it", 7.318, 7.364], ["is", 7.375, 7.466], ["solid", 7.466, 7.92]]}, {"text": "Your money earns a return. And next year, that return earns a return of its own. This is called compound interest.", "start": 67.656, "end": 74.256, "spec": {"type": "growth", "mode": "double", "img": 13}, "words": [["Your", 0.091, 0.182], ["money", 0.182, 0.591], ["earns", 0.602, 0.795], ["a", 0.795, 0.83], ["return", 0.83, 1.227], ["And", 1.602, 1.693], ["next", 1.693, 1.966], ["year", 1.966, 2.239], ["that", 2.625, 2.761], ["return", 2.761, 3.216], ["earns", 3.307, 3.511], ["a", 3.511, 3.545], ["return", 3.545, 3.875], ["of", 3.875, 3.932], ["its", 3.943, 4.045], ["own", 4.045, 4.284], ["This", 4.648, 4.773], ["is", 4.784, 4.852], ["called", 4.864, 5.102], ["compound", 5.102, 5.705], ["interest", 5.716, 6.261]]}, {"text": "At the start it feels ridiculously slow. After a few years your portfolio looks barely different from a piggy bank.", "start": 74.656, "end": 81.448, "spec": {"type": "growth", "mode": "slow", "img": 14}, "words": [["At", 0.08, 0.159], ["the", 0.159, 0.216], ["start", 0.227, 0.477], ["it", 0.477, 0.545], ["feels", 0.545, 0.943], ["ridiculously", 0.943, 1.648], ["slow", 1.648, 2.227], ["After", 2.58, 2.818], ["a", 2.818, 2.852], ["few", 2.864, 3.102], ["years", 3.102, 3.557], ["your", 3.682, 3.807], ["portfolio", 3.807, 4.534], ["looks", 4.636, 4.864], ["barely", 4.977, 5.307], ["different", 5.307, 5.659], ["from", 5.659, 5.784], ["a", 5.784, 5.818], ["piggy", 5.818, 6.091], ["bank", 6.102, 6.455]]}, {"text": "But at some point it tips. Then your money works harder than you do.", "start": 81.848, "end": 85.208, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "workharder", "img": 15}, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.136], ["at", 0.136, 0.193], ["some", 0.193, 0.307], ["point", 0.307, 0.511], ["it", 0.511, 0.591], ["tips", 0.591, 1.045], ["Then", 1.42, 1.489], ["your", 1.489, 1.58], ["money", 1.58, 1.875], ["works", 1.875, 2.102], ["harder", 2.114, 2.443], ["than", 2.455, 2.557], ["you", 2.568, 2.67], ["do", 2.682, 3.034]]}, {"text": "Phase three: what you actually end up with.", "start": 85.608, "end": 88.152, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 3, "title": "What you actually end up with", "img": 16}, "words": [["Phase", 0.159, 0.42], ["three", 0.42, 0.761], ["what", 1.25, 1.352], ["you", 1.352, 1.443], ["actually", 1.443, 1.682], ["end", 1.693, 1.807], ["up", 1.807, 1.932], ["with", 1.932, 2.193]]}, {"text": "After ten years, the coffee money has grown to almost twenty-one thousand euros. You paid in almost fifteen thousand.", "start": 88.552, "end": 95.152, "spec": {"type": "chart", "group": "ch120", "monthly": 120, "year": 10, "step": 0, "img": 17}, "words": [["After", 0.091, 0.295], ["ten", 0.295, 0.523], ["years", 0.523, 1.023], ["the", 1.159, 1.25], ["coffee", 1.25, 1.614], ["money", 1.614, 1.852], ["has", 1.852, 1.955], ["grown", 1.966, 2.33], ["to", 2.33, 2.432], ["almost", 2.432, 2.818], ["twenty-one", 2.83, 3.284], ["thousand", 3.295, 3.636], ["euros", 3.648, 4.17], ["You", 4.534, 4.602], ["paid", 4.602, 4.83], ["in", 4.83, 4.909], ["almost", 4.92, 5.25], ["fifteen", 5.25, 5.761], ["thousand", 5.773, 6.25]]}, {"text": "After twenty years it is around sixty-two thousand euros, with about twenty-nine thousand paid in.", "start": 95.552, "end": 101.168, "spec": {"type": "chart", "group": "ch120", "monthly": 120, "year": 20, "step": 1, "img": 18}, "words": [["After", 0.091, 0.295], ["twenty", 0.307, 0.568], ["years", 0.568, 1.034], ["it", 1.159, 1.239], ["is", 1.25, 1.341], ["around", 1.341, 1.705], ["sixty-two", 1.705, 2.398], ["thousand", 2.398, 2.795], ["euros", 2.795, 3.307], ["with", 3.511, 3.625], ["about", 3.625, 3.875], ["twenty-nine", 3.875, 4.432], ["thousand", 4.432, 4.83], ["paid", 4.83, 5.057], ["in", 5.068, 5.273]]}, {"text": "After thirty years it is roughly one hundred and forty-two thousand euros. That is already a lot of money.", "start": 101.568, "end": 107.208, "spec": {"type": "chart", "group": "ch120", "monthly": 120, "year": 30, "step": 2, "img": 19}, "words": [["After", 0.091, 0.318], ["thirty", 0.33, 0.693], ["years", 0.693, 1.159], ["it", 1.307, 1.386], ["is", 1.386, 1.523], ["roughly", 1.534, 1.898], ["one", 1.898, 2.102], ["hundred", 2.102, 2.318], ["and", 2.318, 2.352], ["forty-two", 2.364, 2.943], ["thousand", 2.955, 3.33], ["euros", 3.341, 3.875], ["That", 4.25, 4.318], ["is", 4.33, 4.42], ["already", 4.42, 4.67], ["a", 4.67, 4.705], ["lot", 4.716, 4.909], ["of", 4.909, 4.955], ["money", 4.955, 5.307]]}, {"text": "And after forty years, you land at about three hundred thousand euros.", "start": 107.608, "end": 111.976, "spec": {"type": "chart", "group": "ch120", "monthly": 120, "year": 40, "step": 3, "img": 20}, "words": [["And", 0.08, 0.193], ["after", 0.307, 0.557], ["forty", 0.557, 0.898], ["years", 0.909, 1.432], ["you", 1.625, 1.784], ["land", 1.784, 2.102], ["at", 2.102, 2.205], ["about", 2.205, 2.489], ["three", 2.648, 2.943], ["hundred", 2.943, 3.17], ["thousand", 3.17, 3.511], ["euros", 3.511, 4.034]]}, {"text": "That is strong. But it is not a million yet.", "start": 112.376, "end": 114.8, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "progress", "img": 21}, "words": [["That", 0.08, 0.148], ["is", 0.148, 0.239], ["strong", 0.25, 0.705], ["But", 1.068, 1.125], ["it", 1.125, 1.17], ["is", 1.17, 1.25], ["not", 1.25, 1.42], ["a", 1.42, 1.455], ["million", 1.455, 1.795], ["yet", 1.795, 2.102]]}, {"text": "Phase four: the uncomfortable truth.", "start": 115.2, "end": 117.864, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 4, "title": "The uncomfortable truth", "img": 22}, "words": [["Phase", 0.148, 0.386], ["four", 0.386, 0.716], ["the", 1.08, 1.193], ["uncomfortable", 1.205, 1.83], ["truth", 1.841, 2.318]]}, {"text": "So the line about coffee making you a millionaire is not quite right. It is more of a good start.", "start": 118.264, "end": 123.256, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "mythstrike", "img": 23}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.17], ["the", 0.17, 0.25], ["line", 0.261, 0.466], ["about", 0.466, 0.693], ["coffee", 0.693, 1.034], ["making", 1.034, 1.341], ["you", 1.352, 1.443], ["a", 1.455, 1.477], ["millionaire", 1.477, 2.08], ["is", 2.273, 2.386], ["not", 2.386, 2.682], ["quite", 2.693, 3.023], ["right", 3.023, 3.386], ["It", 3.75, 3.784], ["is", 3.784, 3.864], ["more", 3.864, 4.023], ["of", 4.023, 4.068], ["a", 4.068, 4.102], ["good", 4.114, 4.273], ["start", 4.273, 4.659]]}, {"text": "If you want a million in forty years, you need about four hundred euros a month at seven percent return.", "start": 123.656, "end": 129.08, "spec": {"type": "bars", "group": "bars", "step": 0, "img": 24}, "words": [["If", 0.091, 0.159], ["you", 0.17, 0.227], ["want", 0.239, 0.352], ["a", 0.352, 0.386], ["million", 0.386, 0.807], ["in", 0.807, 0.909], ["forty", 0.909, 1.295], ["years", 1.295, 1.773], ["you", 1.966, 2.08], ["need", 2.08, 2.205], ["about", 2.205, 2.432], ["four", 2.432, 2.75], ["hundred", 2.761, 2.966], ["euros", 2.966, 3.273], ["a", 3.273, 3.307], ["month", 3.307, 3.75], ["at", 3.943, 4.011], ["seven", 4.023, 4.386], ["percent", 4.386, 4.705], ["return", 4.716, 5.08]]}, {"text": "At five percent return, it is already around six hundred and seventy-five euros a month.", "start": 129.48, "end": 134.616, "spec": {"type": "bars", "group": "bars", "step": 1, "img": 25}, "words": [["At", 0.091, 0.193], ["five", 0.193, 0.523], ["percent", 0.523, 0.852], ["return", 0.864, 1.307], ["it", 1.705, 1.773], ["is", 1.784, 1.886], ["already", 1.898, 2.284], ["around", 2.284, 2.716], ["six", 2.727, 2.989], ["hundred", 2.989, 3.205], ["and", 3.205, 3.239], ["seventy-five", 3.239, 3.955], ["euros", 3.955, 4.307], ["a", 4.307, 4.33], ["month", 4.341, 4.795]]}, {"text": "And if you want to get there in thirty years, you need about eight hundred and fifty euros a month at seven percent.", "start": 135.016, "end": 140.488, "spec": {"type": "bars", "group": "bars", "step": 2, "img": 26}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.148], ["if", 0.148, 0.216], ["you", 0.227, 0.284], ["want", 0.284, 0.364], ["to", 0.364, 0.409], ["get", 0.42, 0.58], ["there", 0.58, 0.795], ["in", 0.795, 0.909], ["thirty", 0.909, 1.273], ["years", 1.273, 1.795], ["you", 1.989, 2.102], ["need", 2.102, 2.239], ["about", 2.239, 2.5], ["eight", 2.636, 2.716], ["hundred", 2.727, 2.966], ["and", 2.966, 3.011], ["fifty", 3.023, 3.352], ["euros", 3.352, 3.693], ["a", 3.693, 3.727], ["month", 3.727, 4.136], ["at", 4.273, 4.341], ["seven", 4.341, 4.636], ["percent", 4.636, 5.136]]}, {"text": "So a million is not about coffee. It is about time and savings rate.", "start": 140.888, "end": 144.92, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "right", "ov": "levers", "img": 27}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.261], ["a", 0.261, 0.284], ["million", 0.295, 0.659], ["is", 0.659, 0.739], ["not", 0.739, 0.898], ["about", 0.898, 1.091], ["coffee", 1.091, 1.545], ["It", 1.92, 1.966], ["is", 1.966, 2.045], ["about", 2.057, 2.307], ["time", 2.307, 2.693], ["and", 2.852, 2.943], ["savings", 2.955, 3.352], ["rate", 3.364, 3.682]]}, {"text": "Phase five: and what about one hundred euros a month?", "start": 145.32, "end": 148.416, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 5, "title": "What about €100 a month?", "img": 28}, "words": [["Phase", 0.148, 0.364], ["five", 0.375, 0.818], ["and", 1.261, 1.33], ["what", 1.33, 1.409], ["about", 1.409, 1.614], ["one", 1.614, 1.716], ["hundred", 1.727, 2.034], ["euros", 2.034, 2.33], ["a", 2.33, 2.352], ["month", 2.364, 2.761]]}, {"text": "One hundred euros a month is realistic for many people. It is the number where most say: I can do that.", "start": 148.816, "end": 154.912, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "hundred", "img": 29}, "words": [["One", 0.091, 0.159], ["hundred", 0.159, 0.398], ["euros", 0.398, 0.659], ["a", 0.659, 0.682], ["month", 0.682, 1.08], ["is", 1.364, 1.534], ["realistic", 1.545, 2.227], ["for", 2.341, 2.477], ["many", 2.477, 2.727], ["people", 2.727, 3.148], ["It", 3.511, 3.557], ["is", 3.568, 3.636], ["the", 3.636, 3.693], ["number", 3.693, 3.932], ["where", 3.932, 4.045], ["most", 4.045, 4.318], ["say", 4.318, 4.705], ["I", 5.091, 5.17], ["can", 5.17, 5.273], ["do", 5.273, 5.466], ["that", 5.466, 5.75]]}, {"text": "After thirty years at seven percent, that is almost one hundred and seventeen thousand euros. You paid in only thirty-six thousand.", "start": 155.312, "end": 163.232, "spec": {"type": "chart", "group": "ch100", "monthly": 100, "year": 30, "step": 0, "img": 30}, "words": [["After", 0.091, 0.318], ["thirty", 0.318, 0.682], ["years", 0.682, 1.148], ["at", 1.273, 1.455], ["seven", 1.466, 1.875], ["percent", 1.886, 2.398], ["that", 2.773, 2.875], ["is", 2.875, 2.977], ["almost", 2.989, 3.409], ["one", 3.409, 3.5], ["hundred", 3.5, 3.795], ["and", 3.795, 3.841], ["seventeen", 3.841, 4.489], ["thousand", 4.489, 4.864], ["euros", 4.864, 5.375], ["You", 5.75, 5.818], ["paid", 5.818, 6.08], ["in", 6.08, 6.182], ["only", 6.193, 6.5], ["thirty-six", 6.511, 7.136], ["thousand", 7.136, 7.591]]}, {"text": "After forty years it is about two hundred and forty-seven thousand euros, with forty-eight thousand paid in.", "start": 163.632, "end": 169.704, "spec": {"type": "chart", "group": "ch100", "monthly": 100, "year": 40, "step": 1, "img": 31}, "words": [["After", 0.091, 0.318], ["forty", 0.318, 0.659], ["years", 0.67, 1.102], ["it", 1.25, 1.318], ["is", 1.318, 1.409], ["about", 1.409, 1.693], ["two", 1.83, 2.045], ["hundred", 2.057, 2.25], ["and", 2.25, 2.307], ["forty-seven", 2.318, 3.023], ["thousand", 3.023, 3.398], ["euros", 3.398, 3.898], ["with", 4.091, 4.216], ["forty-eight", 4.216, 4.852], ["thousand", 4.864, 5.307], ["paid", 5.307, 5.534], ["in", 5.534, 5.727]]}, {"text": "So the gain is many times what you put in yourself. That is the magic of time.", "start": 170.104, "end": 174.376, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "split", "img": 32}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.182], ["the", 0.182, 0.261], ["gain", 0.261, 0.545], ["is", 0.557, 0.67], ["many", 0.67, 1.045], ["times", 1.045, 1.398], ["what", 1.398, 1.477], ["you", 1.477, 1.591], ["put", 1.602, 1.761], ["in", 1.761, 1.83], ["yourself", 1.83, 2.375], ["That", 2.75, 2.818], ["is", 2.83, 2.909], ["the", 2.909, 2.966], ["magic", 2.977, 3.489], ["of", 3.5, 3.58], ["time", 3.58, 3.943]]}, {"text": "But it does not make you rich. Above all, it makes you free, flexible and independent.", "start": 174.776, "end": 180.08, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "free", "img": 33}, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.136], ["it", 0.136, 0.17], ["does", 0.182, 0.284], ["not", 0.284, 0.489], ["make", 0.489, 0.682], ["you", 0.693, 0.807], ["rich", 0.807, 1.261], ["Above", 1.636, 1.875], ["all", 1.875, 2.159], ["it", 2.614, 2.67], ["makes", 2.67, 2.841], ["you", 2.841, 2.932], ["free", 2.943, 3.455], ["flexible", 3.659, 4.33], ["and", 4.33, 4.398], ["independent", 4.398, 4.966]]}, {"text": "Phase six: the biggest lever is not the return.", "start": 180.48, "end": 184.08, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 6, "title": "The biggest lever is not the return", "img": 34}, "words": [["Phase", 0.159, 0.489], ["six", 0.5, 1.045], ["the", 1.386, 1.489], ["biggest", 1.5, 1.83], ["lever", 1.83, 2.148], ["is", 2.227, 2.341], ["not", 2.341, 2.75], ["the", 2.761, 2.83], ["return", 2.841, 3.261]]}, {"text": "Many people hunt for the perfect stock or the best tip. But three things matter far more.", "start": 184.48, "end": 189.64, "spec": {"type": "list", "img": 34}, "words": [["Many", 0.091, 0.25], ["people", 0.25, 0.545], ["hunt", 0.545, 0.83], ["for", 0.875, 0.989], ["the", 0.989, 1.057], ["perfect", 1.057, 1.432], ["stock", 1.443, 1.875], ["or", 2.0, 2.068], ["the", 2.068, 2.136], ["best", 2.148, 2.432], ["tip", 2.432, 2.705], ["But", 3.08, 3.182], ["three", 3.182, 3.545], ["things", 3.545, 3.898], ["matter", 3.898, 4.216], ["far", 4.216, 4.455], ["more", 4.455, 4.818]]}, {"text": "First: how early you start. If you start at nineteen, you have a ten-year head start on someone who starts at twenty-nine.", "start": 190.04, "end": 196.28, "spec": {"type": "img", "img": 35, "lay": "full", "ov": "headstart", "num": 1}, "words": [["First", 0.159, 0.534], ["how", 0.898, 1.045], ["early", 1.045, 1.295], ["you", 1.295, 1.375], ["start", 1.386, 1.761], ["If", 2.136, 2.216], ["you", 2.216, 2.273], ["start", 2.284, 2.5], ["at", 2.511, 2.557], ["nineteen", 2.557, 3.091], ["you", 3.352, 3.409], ["have", 3.42, 3.5], ["a", 3.5, 3.557], ["ten-year", 3.557, 3.909], ["head", 3.909, 4.17], ["start", 4.182, 4.409], ["on", 4.409, 4.557], ["someone", 4.568, 4.841], ["who", 4.841, 4.943], ["starts", 4.943, 5.307], ["at", 5.318, 5.364], ["twenty-nine", 5.375, 5.886]]}, {"text": "Second: how much you invest. If you raise your savings rate when your salary rises, it changes everything.", "start": 196.68, "end": 203.352, "spec": {"type": "img", "img": 36, "lay": "right", "ov": "rate", "num": 2}, "words": [["Second", 0.102, 0.443], ["how", 0.943, 1.011], ["much", 1.011, 1.17], ["you", 1.17, 1.273], ["invest", 1.284, 1.784], ["If", 2.148, 2.239], ["you", 2.25, 2.409], ["raise", 2.42, 2.716], ["your", 2.716, 2.807], ["savings", 2.807, 3.261], ["rate", 3.261, 3.591], ["when", 3.67, 3.795], ["your", 3.807, 3.886], ["salary", 3.886, 4.307], ["rises", 4.307, 4.841], ["it", 5.216, 5.284], ["changes", 5.284, 5.773], ["everything", 5.773, 6.341]]}, {"text": "Third: how long you stay in. Anyone who sells at every crash almost always loses.", "start": 203.752, "end": 209.368, "spec": {"type": "img", "img": 37, "lay": "left", "ov": "stayin", "num": 3}, "words": [["Third", 0.114, 0.364], ["how", 0.761, 0.841], ["long", 0.841, 1.102], ["you", 1.102, 1.17], ["stay", 1.17, 1.432], ["in", 1.432, 1.591], ["Anyone", 1.932, 2.205], ["who", 2.205, 2.318], ["sells", 2.318, 2.693], ["at", 2.693, 2.886], ["every", 3.034, 3.307], ["crash", 3.307, 3.864], ["almost", 3.943, 4.307], ["always", 4.386, 4.727], ["loses", 4.727, 5.284]]}, {"text": "Phase seven: what gets in the way in real life.", "start": 209.768, "end": 212.624, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 7, "title": "What gets in the way in real life", "img": 39}, "words": [["Phase", 0.148, 0.341], ["seven", 0.352, 0.727], ["what", 1.159, 1.273], ["gets", 1.273, 1.443], ["in", 1.443, 1.5], ["the", 1.5, 1.557], ["way", 1.557, 1.784], ["in", 1.795, 1.898], ["real", 1.898, 2.114], ["life", 2.114, 2.511]]}, {"text": "First, inflation. Your money loses a bit of buying power every year. A million in forty years is worth less than a million today.", "start": 213.024, "end": 220.944, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "inflation", "num": 1, "img": 40}, "words": [["First", 0.136, 0.455], ["inflation", 0.545, 1.136], ["Your", 1.511, 1.602], ["money", 1.614, 1.898], ["loses", 1.898, 2.25], ["a", 2.25, 2.295], ["bit", 2.307, 2.409], ["of", 2.42, 2.477], ["buying", 2.477, 2.727], ["power", 2.727, 3.136], ["every", 3.318, 3.545], ["year", 3.545, 3.886], ["A", 4.227, 4.273], ["million", 4.273, 4.705], ["in", 4.705, 4.807], ["forty", 4.807, 5.216], ["years", 5.216, 5.705], ["is", 5.852, 5.989], ["worth", 5.989, 6.364], ["less", 6.409, 6.682], ["than", 6.693, 6.784], ["a", 6.784, 6.818], ["million", 6.818, 7.17], ["today", 7.182, 7.58]]}, {"text": "Second, taxes and costs. Gains are taxed, and funds have ongoing fees.", "start": 221.344, "end": 226.672, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "tax", "num": 2, "img": 41}, "words": [["Second", 0.091, 0.5], ["taxes", 0.852, 1.307], ["and", 1.307, 1.386], ["costs", 1.398, 2.0], ["Gains", 2.364, 2.568], ["are", 2.568, 2.648], ["taxed", 2.659, 3.25], ["and", 3.5, 3.568], ["funds", 3.568, 3.841], ["have", 3.841, 3.977], ["ongoing", 3.989, 4.42], ["fees", 4.432, 4.989]]}, {"text": "Third, swings. Your portfolio can drop on paper by thirty or forty percent for a while.", "start": 227.072, "end": 233.12, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "right", "ov": "drawdown", "num": 3, "img": 42}, "words": [["Third", 0.125, 0.375], ["swings", 0.455, 1.102], ["Your", 1.477, 1.568], ["portfolio", 1.568, 2.182], ["can", 2.182, 2.295], ["drop", 2.295, 2.557], ["on", 2.557, 2.682], ["paper", 2.682, 3.091], ["by", 3.284, 3.443], ["thirty", 3.545, 4.011], ["or", 4.17, 4.295], ["forty", 4.295, 4.67], ["percent", 4.67, 5.114], ["for", 5.125, 5.261], ["a", 5.261, 5.307], ["while", 5.307, 5.716]]}, {"text": "And the hardest part is not the math. It is keeping your nerves in those moments.", "start": 233.52, "end": 237.864, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "nerves", "img": 43}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.148], ["the", 0.148, 0.193], ["hardest", 0.193, 0.489], ["part", 0.489, 0.761], ["is", 0.875, 0.989], ["not", 0.989, 1.318], ["the", 1.318, 1.375], ["math", 1.386, 1.898], ["It", 2.273, 2.318], ["is", 2.318, 2.398], ["keeping", 2.398, 2.659], ["your", 2.67, 2.75], ["nerves", 2.75, 3.17], ["in", 3.182, 3.25], ["those", 3.25, 3.432], ["moments", 3.432, 4.011]]}, {"text": "Phase eight: how to keep it simple.", "start": 238.264, "end": 240.664, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 8, "title": "How to keep it simple", "img": 44}, "words": [["Phase", 0.182, 0.432], ["eight", 0.432, 0.682], ["how", 1.239, 1.284], ["to", 1.295, 1.375], ["keep", 1.375, 1.557], ["it", 1.557, 1.614], ["simple", 1.614, 2.068]]}, {"text": "Many beginners use a broadly diversified world ETF. It bundles thousands of companies into a single product.", "start": 241.064, "end": 248.216, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "tiles", "img": 45}, "words": [["Many", 0.091, 0.295], ["beginners", 0.295, 0.818], ["use", 0.92, 1.114], ["a", 1.125, 1.205], ["broadly", 1.216, 1.693], ["diversified", 1.693, 2.432], ["world", 2.443, 2.75], ["ETF", 2.886, 3.568], ["It", 3.943, 4.068], ["bundles", 4.08, 4.489], ["thousands", 4.5, 5.023], ["of", 5.034, 5.102], ["companies", 5.102, 5.648], ["into", 5.75, 5.989], ["a", 5.989, 6.045], ["single", 6.045, 6.375], ["product", 6.386, 6.841]]}, {"text": "Instead of betting on one winner, you buy the whole market. It is boring, but that is exactly the point.", "start": 248.616, "end": 253.992, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "market", "img": 46}, "words": [["Instead", 0.091, 0.352], ["of", 0.364, 0.466], ["betting", 0.477, 0.727], ["on", 0.727, 0.864], ["one", 0.864, 1.08], ["winner", 1.08, 1.386], ["you", 1.818, 1.955], ["buy", 1.955, 2.125], ["the", 2.125, 2.182], ["whole", 2.182, 2.398], ["market", 2.398, 2.795], ["It", 3.17, 3.227], ["is", 3.227, 3.318], ["boring", 3.318, 3.693], ["but", 3.705, 3.83], ["that", 3.841, 3.989], ["is", 3.989, 4.068], ["exactly", 4.068, 4.557], ["the", 4.557, 4.625], ["point", 4.625, 5.023]]}, {"text": "A savings plan buys automatically every month, whether prices are high or low. You do not have to wait for the right moment.", "start": 254.392, "end": 261.544, "spec": {"type": "dca", "img": 47}, "words": [["A", 0.091, 0.136], ["savings", 0.136, 0.511], ["plan", 0.523, 0.955], ["buys", 1.034, 1.489], ["automatically", 1.602, 2.307], ["every", 2.352, 2.625], ["month", 2.636, 3.102], ["whether", 3.341, 3.534], ["prices", 3.534, 3.92], ["are", 3.92, 3.989], ["high", 4.0, 4.318], ["or", 4.33, 4.466], ["low", 4.477, 4.83], ["You", 5.193, 5.227], ["do", 5.227, 5.341], ["not", 5.341, 5.466], ["have", 5.477, 5.614], ["to", 5.625, 5.705], ["wait", 5.705, 5.989], ["for", 5.989, 6.08], ["the", 6.091, 6.148], ["right", 6.148, 6.386], ["moment", 6.386, 6.807]]}, {"text": "Before that, though, you should have an emergency fund, so you do not have to sell your portfolio when something unexpected happens.", "start": 261.944, "end": 269.288, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "right", "ov": "emergency", "img": 48}, "words": [["Before", 0.091, 0.409], ["that", 0.409, 0.716], ["though", 1.091, 1.409], ["you", 1.807, 1.909], ["should", 1.92, 2.08], ["have", 2.08, 2.284], ["an", 2.284, 2.33], ["emergency", 2.33, 2.886], ["fund", 2.898, 3.33], ["so", 3.58, 3.682], ["you", 3.682, 3.75], ["do", 3.75, 3.898], ["not", 3.898, 4.068], ["have", 4.08, 4.261], ["to", 4.273, 4.318], ["sell", 4.318, 4.523], ["your", 4.523, 4.614], ["portfolio", 4.625, 5.318], ["when", 5.455, 5.568], ["something", 5.568, 5.92], ["unexpected", 5.92, 6.466], ["happens", 6.466, 7.011]]}, {"text": "And if you have high-interest debt, paying it off is usually the safer return.", "start": 269.688, "end": 274.032, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "left", "ov": "debt", "img": 49}, "words": [["And", 0.08, 0.136], ["if", 0.136, 0.205], ["you", 0.205, 0.284], ["have", 0.284, 0.523], ["high-interest", 0.534, 1.091], ["debt", 1.091, 1.352], ["paying", 1.727, 2.023], ["it", 2.023, 2.08], ["off", 2.08, 2.386], ["is", 2.511, 2.67], ["usually", 2.682, 3.136], ["the", 3.136, 3.216], ["safer", 3.216, 3.614], ["return", 3.614, 4.0]]}, {"text": "This was not financial advice, just a worked example. The decision is yours, ideally after your own research.", "start": 274.432, "end": 280.96, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "advice", "img": 50}, "words": [["This", 0.091, 0.17], ["was", 0.182, 0.273], ["not", 0.273, 0.466], ["financial", 0.477, 0.943], ["advice", 0.943, 1.523], ["just", 1.67, 1.818], ["a", 1.83, 1.864], ["worked", 1.864, 2.114], ["example", 2.125, 2.693], ["The", 3.057, 3.114], ["decision", 3.114, 3.602], ["is", 3.614, 3.784], ["yours", 3.784, 4.386], ["ideally", 4.739, 5.182], ["after", 5.182, 5.364], ["your", 5.364, 5.455], ["own", 5.466, 5.602], ["research", 5.602, 6.205]]}, {"text": "Phase nine: the honest answer.", "start": 281.36, "end": 283.64, "spec": {"type": "phase", "n": 9, "title": "The honest answer", "img": 51}, "words": [["Phase", 0.159, 0.375], ["nine", 0.386, 0.761], ["the", 1.114, 1.216], ["honest", 1.216, 1.557], ["answer", 1.557, 1.932]]}, {"text": "Does one coffee a day make you a millionaire? No. Not on its own, not in twenty years, and not without patience.", "start": 284.04, "end": 291.408, "spec": {"type": "img", "lay": "full", "ov": "answer", "img": 52}, "words": [["Does", 0.091, 0.216], ["one", 0.216, 0.466], ["coffee", 0.466, 0.852], ["a", 0.852, 0.898], ["day", 0.898, 1.17], ["make", 1.352, 1.534], ["you", 1.534, 1.636], ["a", 1.636, 1.67], ["millionaire", 1.67, 2.136], ["No.", 2.5, 2.761], ["Not", 3.114, 3.307], ["on", 3.307, 3.42], ["its", 3.432, 3.557], ["own", 3.557, 3.852], ["not", 4.295, 4.477], ["in", 4.489, 4.591], ["twenty", 4.591, 4.886], ["years", 4.886, 5.409], ["and", 5.602, 5.773], ["not", 5.784, 6.045], ["without", 6.057, 6.42], ["patience", 6.42, 7.023]]}, {"text": "But it can build you a six-figure fortune if you start early and stick with it.", "start": 291.808, "end": 295.96, "spec": {"type": "stat", "img": 53, "value": 300000, "pre": "€", "label": "six-figure fortune", "sub": "€120 a month · 40 years · 7 % (example)"}, "words": [["But", 0.102, 0.148], ["it", 0.159, 0.216], ["can", 0.227, 0.318], ["build", 0.318, 0.591], ["you", 0.591, 0.75], ["a", 0.83, 0.886], ["six-figure", 0.898, 1.42], ["fortune", 1.42, 1.886], ["if", 2.06